# Scoring API requests for the REST Client extension (VS Code) or the Rider / Visual Studio HTTP client.
# Default target: docker compose (port 8080). For `dotnet run` use http://localhost:5077.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = dev-key-change-me
@applicationId = 6f1c2b9e-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health (no key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Evaluate — success (APPROVE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-approve-001

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### Evaluate — success (REVIEW)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 1000000.00,
  "termMonths": 36,
  "monthlyIncome": 100000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CAR"
}

### Evaluate — success (REJECT: rate and monthlyPayment are null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 2000000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 100000.00,
  "purposeCode": "OTHER"
}

### 400 — amount out of range
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### 400 — term out of range
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": 120,
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### 400 — income out of range
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 0,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### 400 — unknown purposeCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "GOLD"
}

### 400 — empty applicationId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### 400 — several errors at once (missing fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}"
}

### 400 — malformed JSON / wrong field type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": "twenty-four",
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### 401 — missing X-Api-Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "amount": 500000.00,
  "termMonths": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 120000.00,
  "purposeCode": "CONSUMER"
}

### 401 — wrong X-Api-Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/{{applicationId}}/history
X-Api-Key: wrong-key

### History (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/{{applicationId}}/history
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### History — no records (empty array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/history
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
